  title: Prarthana Samaj
  text: The Prarthana Samaj was founded in Bombay in 1867 by Atmaram Pandurang, inspired by the Brahmo Samaj. M. G. Ranade and R. G. Bhandarkar promoted inter-caste dining, widow remarriage and education for women.
